heonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-25T16:16:03-07:00","id":1398890,"title":"","content":"Cool ! Thanks for your answers !<br /> Due to the lack of informations, I personnally thought that it would be cancelled !<br /> Speaking about that, anybody knows what kind of new content will we see in this book ? I heard we won't get Tzimisces and Ravnos, so what can we get in that ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24796-honeyarty","name":"HoneyArty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-25T23:34:25-07:00","id":1398954,"title":"","content":"My money's on 34 pages that spell out &quot;You want to play Sabbat? F--- you!&quot; in 500-point all caps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-26T01:29:45-07:00","id":1398972,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1347367-v5-player-s-guide-eta?p=1398954#post1398954\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My money's on 34 pages that spell out &quot;You want to play Sabbat? F--- you!&quot; in 500-point all caps.</div> </div> </div> </div>With a final lovely inscription: &quot;With our best wishes to M*, T*, S*, and all those outraged Sabbat fans out there in the Onyx Fora; we read all your messages&quot; <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> (Just a joke, please don't hate me)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;No, no, don't look any further, my profile is actually more handsome than me&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3586-alqamar-alaswad","name":"Alqamar Alaswad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"287"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-26T09:24:05-07:00","id":1399084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HoneyArty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1347367-v5-player-s-guide-eta?p=1398890#post1398890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cool ! Thanks for your answers !<br /> Due to the lack of informations, I personnally thought that it would be cancelled !<br /> Speaking about that, anybody knows what kind of new content will we see in this book ? I heard we won't get Tzimisces and Ravnos, so what can we get in that ?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I posted about what we were told in various interviews further up the thread, but to copy/paste it again:<br /> * Ways to change up the game and rules, with things to use with the core book, but not replace it<br /> * Discipline powers and Amalgams (not reprints from existing books)<br /> * Merits, Flaws and Backgrounds<br /> * Loresheets<br /> * Clans (which is one of the delay reasons, it originally went from 13 to possibly 12, the Ravnos are out according to one of the devs and the Tzimisce may be out if Modiphius can't fix the issues with it) including clans from other books like Lasombra and Hecata. These will have the same metaplot stuff as the currently playable ones (so no Sabbat Lasombra) but won't be copy/pastes from those books (as in, they'll have more Oblivion powers to go along with the more powers of the book). <br /> <br /> Pretty much the same stuff that past players guides have given in terms of character options.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-26T01:03:12-07:00","id":1410465,"title":"","content":"So I guess we are on year three past the delivery date? Is this Exalted 3E?<br /> <br /> Have there been any news?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","name":"Kammerer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12892_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-26T01:13:11-07:00","id":1410468,"title":"","content":"It's probably entirely scheduled around the Bloodlines 2 release date.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Gogo Baccala<br /> <br /> Drag Queen, Ex-Attorney, Freelance Deity","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26376-gogobaccala","name":"Gogobaccala","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-26T07:56:58-07:00","id":1410514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kammerer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1347367-v5-player-s-guide-eta?p=1410465#post1410465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I guess we are on year three past the delivery date? Is this Exalted 3E?<br /> <br /> Have there been any news?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it\u2019s currently only a year and a half behind schedule. First it was \u201cSummer 2019,\u201d then \u201cadvanced PDFs in Dec 2019,\u201d then \u201cafter March but before GenCon,\u201d then \u201cbefore November (2020)\u201d and I think soon it will be \u201csometime early 2021\u201d if it isn\u2019t already.<br /> <br /> They really don\u2019t want to release it before deciding on the correct way to pronounce Tzimisce.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24351-garygeneric","name":"Garygeneric","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-26T09:39:32-07:00","id":1410525,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kammerer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1347367-v5-player-s-guide-eta?p=1410465#post1410465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I guess we are on year three past the delivery date? Is this Exalted 3E?<br /> <br /> Have there been any news?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Others have inquired with them on Facebook and were told they're waiting on decisions from Paradox. So that's all we know at this time. Considering they didn't have a Brand Content Manager until Justin was hired recently, I would bank on that being the main crux of the hold up, after the last time we heard about rewrites from Dawkins.<br /> <br /> Modiphius does not do like Onyx Path with 'weekly updates' of the status of titles though. Their weekly updates are all about things currently out/immediately coming out for purchase/related things.<br /> <br /> So we won't hear anything 'official' until it's actually ready to go anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link